\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 ## Project Summary
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Foodie}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 \hich\f37  is a graduate-level Flutter application designed as a \'93\loch\f37 \hich\f37 Tinder for Food
\'94\loch\f37  experience. It helps students discover on-campus restaurants within walking distance through an intuitive swipe interface.
\par \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 The core loop is simple:
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 1.\tab}}\pard \ltrpar\ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\nowidctlpar
\jclisttab\tx720\wrapdefault\faauto\ls1\rin0\lin720\itap0\pararsid16401567 {\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Discover:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37  View one restaurant at a time with photos and key details.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\ltrpar \rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 2.\tab}}{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 
\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 Decide:}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37  Swipe }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 
\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 right}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 \hich\f37  to \'93\loch\f37 \hich\f37 match\'94\loch\f37 
 and save the restaurant to a local basket; swipe }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 \hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37 left}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af37 \ltrch\fcs0 \f37\kerning0\insrsid16401567\charrsid16401567 
\hich\af37\dbch\af31505\loch\f37  to discard it for the current session.
